<title>FRANCE: French boy caught shoplifting commits suicide.</title>
<headline>French boy caught shoplifting commits suicide.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>An 11-year-old boy committed suicide in the southwest city of Toulouse after being caught shoplifting a toy worth 70 francs ($14) at a Christmas sale, a police spokeswoman said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The boy, whose identity was not disclosed, leaped from a seventh floor window of his family's flat after police drove him home and told his parents what he had done, the spokeswoman said.</p>
